Date: Fri, 30 Aug 2024 14:48:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 139/572] feat(st-crypto): change PKA compatible name
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Change compatible name of PKA to match other ST device tree

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 2aef16ccd62e31f6c3d5b1dec41ddaa4ff4b65e5 feat(st-crypto): change PKA compatible name]
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I2176950d06567473a23d313afd85c74d32586d14
---
 drivers/st/crypto/stm32_pka.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/st/crypto/stm32_pka.c b/drivers/st/crypto/stm32_pka.c
index 3054577420..93249370ea 100644
--- a/drivers/st/crypto/stm32_pka.c
+++ b/drivers/st/crypto/stm32_pka.c
@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@
 #define OP_NBW_FROM_SIZE(s)		OP_NBW_FROM_LEN((s) * UINT8_LEN)
 #define OP_SIZE_FROM_SIZE(s)		(OP_NBW_FROM_SIZE(s) * PKA_WORD_SIZE)
 
-#define DT_PKA_COMPAT			"st,stm32-pka64"
+#define DT_PKA_COMPAT			"st,stm32mp13-pka64"
 
 #define MAX_ECC_SIZE_LEN		640U
 #define MAX_EO_NBW			OP_NBW_FROM_LEN(MAX_ECC_SIZE_LEN)
